#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.4.0.rst:115
msgid "WiFi socket timeout and LCD vertical flip *(behavior)*"
msgstr "Timeout dei socket WiFi e flip verticale LCD *(comportamento)*"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.4.0.rst:117
msgid ""
"A WINC1500 socket timeout now returns a non-blocking error (``EWOULDBLOCK``)"
" instead of ``ETIMEDOUT``, so timed-out sockets are no longer unexpectedly "
"closed — code that caught ``ETIMEDOUT`` must be updated. The SPI LCD shield "
":mod:`display` now raises ``ValueError`` (\"Vertical flip requires triple "
"buffering!\") when a negative ``y_scale`` is requested without triple "
"buffering enabled."
msgstr ""
"Un timeout di un socket WINC1500 ora restituisce un errore non bloccante (\\"
" ``EWOULDBLOCK``\\ ) invece di ``ETIMEDOUT``\\ , così i socket scaduti non "
"vengono più chiusi inaspettatamente: il codice che intercettava "
"``ETIMEDOUT`` deve essere aggiornato. Il :mod:`display` dello shield LCD SPI"
" ora solleva ``ValueError`` (\"Vertical flip requires triple buffering!\") "
"quando viene richiesto un ``y_scale`` negativo senza il triple buffering "
"abilitato."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.4.0.rst:124
msgid ""
"*Commits:* `1dc4bea88 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/1dc4bea88>`__, `7e52cf751 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/7e52cf751>`__"
msgstr ""
"*Commit:* `1dc4bea88 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/1dc4bea88>`__\\ , `7e52cf751 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/7e52cf751>`__"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.4.0.rst:130
msgid "Migration checklist"
msgstr "Checklist di migrazione"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.4.0.rst:132
msgid "For a clean port to v4.4.0 the typical work is:"
msgstr "Per un porting pulito alla v4.4.0 il lavoro tipico è:"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.4.0.rst:134
msgid ""
"On the Nicla Vision, stop using ``lcd``/``tv``; on the Nano RP2040 Connect, "
"port WiFi code to the upstream NINA-W10 driver (:ref:`the board module "
"changes <v4_4_0_board>`)."
msgstr ""
"Sulla Nicla Vision, smetti di usare ``lcd``\\ /\\ ``tv``\\ ; sul Nano RP2040"
" Connect, porta il codice WiFi al driver upstream NINA-W10 (\\ :ref:`le "
"modifiche al modulo della scheda <v4_4_0_board>`\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.4.0.rst:137
msgid ""
"Update WINC1500 socket code to expect ``EWOULDBLOCK`` on timeout, and enable"
" triple buffering for vertically-flipped LCD output (:ref:`the behavior "
"changes <v4_4_0_behavior>`)."
msgstr ""
"Aggiorna il codice dei socket WINC1500 per aspettarsi ``EWOULDBLOCK`` al "
"timeout, e abilita il triple buffering per l'output LCD con flip verticale "
"(\\ :ref:`le modifiche di comportamento <v4_4_0_behavior>`\\ )."
